+-- ===========================================================================
+-- I. no duplicate placement / over-placement regression
+-- ===========================================================================
+-- allocline_a has 10 allocated, 6 already placed (scenario A above).
+-- Placing the remaining 4 succeeds; a further +1 (would total 11) is
